Package: fieldtrial
Title: Field Trial Experimental Design, ANOVA, and Diagnostic Suite
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lunganlung", "P. G.", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "lunganlung@icar.gov.in"))
Description: Pure base-R statistical engine and Shinylive (webR) companion application
    for agricultural and biological field trial analysis. Supports CRD, RCBD (with
    relative efficiency), Latin Square, Two-Way Factorial RCBD, and Split-Plot designs
    with dual Error(a)/Error(b) partitioning, Piepho compact letter display (CLD),
    data transformations (Log, Sqrt, Arcsine), assumption diagnostics, outlier flags,
    spatial residual mapping, replicate power planning, and reproducible R script export.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/field-trial-analyser
BugReports: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/field-trial-analyser/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils,
    graphics,
    grDevices
Suggests:
    shiny,
    bslib

